      "id": "claim_c835dab634e646fbb5cc6e25012c44a7",
      "statement": "At request time, the server validates caller JWTs against OCM's JWKS endpoint via an OCM SDK authentication handler, then internal/auth.Middleware.AuthenticateAccountJWT extracts the caller identity from request context and rejects requests with a missing username claim with 401.",
