    {
      "id": "claim_92c4baca575b4bc1acd6be0d2c02e990",
      "statement": "The Trusted Actions server is built and shipped from components/trusted-actions/Containerfile, a two-stage build: a registry.access.redhat.com/hi/go builder stage runs `go build -o bin/rosa-trusted-actions-server ./cmd/server`, and the binary is copied into a digest-pinned registry.access.redhat.com/hi/core-runtime image that exposes port 8080, runs as non-root user 1001, and sets ENTRYPOINT [\"rosa-trusted-actions-server\"].",
